# The complete projective addition computes the chord-and-tangent addition:
# GA.of_proj(A + B) == GA.add(GA.of_proj(A), GA.of_proj(B)) for points of
# the group (corr). Modulus m = 1 + mp with the field facts of glaw1.bend.
#
# With A or B at infinity the sum is equiv to the other point; otherwise A
# and B are replaced by their normal forms (u1 : v1 : 1), (u2 : v2 : 1), and
# the three cases of SEC 1 2.2.1 are: u1 != u2 (chord: the identities
# aff_id1 give X == x3 Z, Y == y3 Z, and Z != 0 because A + B equiv O would
# make A equiv -B); u1 == u2, v1 == v2 (tangent, aff_id2); u1 == u2 and
# v1 != v2 (then v2 == -v1 and A + B equiv O).

